<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.50 pct, 3-mo 21.33 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.50 pct, 3-mo 21.33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) rose for the one-month maturity and eased for three months on Wednesday, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 21.51 percent, up 0.01, while the three-month rate was fixed at 21.33, down 0.02 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
